Game 1:
Priest finds himself 3 chests filled with goodies on the first 2 levels.
On thrid level, he finds a shop (3x2) filled with ancient weapons.  Not
having seen one of this before, he looked around, and just sitting their
was DemonBane.  After laughing at the offered price, he fetched his 
faithful dog, who then proceeded to empty the shop, include Demonbane.
He enchanted the weapon to +3 with a couple of scrolls and was ready to 
womp...
..but Demonbane would not work.  He hit only 1:7 against a few manes.
Eventully he was trapped with no food, little hp, very weak from hunger,
and the grace of his god absent...
I cant wait to get to this bones level  :) !

Game 2:
Again, a priest located much stuff on the first three levels.  Since he
was well protected (he got a blessed +5 orcish helm!!!) and well armed,
he decided to try a few scrolls (the helm was well protected from destruction).
Unfortunately, one was a punishment, so he then wielded the ball.  Went 
down a few stairs (with my stuff following right along).  After womping
more creatures, I had a better weapon, but I couldnt carry it and the ball,
so I looked for something to remove it.  Found a fountain, #dips the ball,
and unleased a water demon.  However, after fighting a bit, I found that
none of my weapons proved useful, and lead the demon (and my pet) around 2
dungeon levels (I had telepathy and a blindfold).  After a nother 500 turns
or so, I was finally surrounded by 5 demons, and with no escape...

